  "methodology": "Reviewed global issuers with an explicit traded listing and comparable latest reported quarterly total revenue growth of at least 10% year over year, positive reported US GAAP/IFRS net income, and dated issuer/SEC evidence. Order eligible companies by YoY total revenue growth, then net margin. Amounts are absolute reporting-currency units, not millions; no FX conversion is used. Evidence expires 120 days after reporting; quarter period ends must be at most 180 days old and annual fallback period ends at most 450 days old. A recent restatement cannot renew an ancient period. This curated shortlist is not an exhaustive global screen or a claim to identify the world's fastest-growing or most-profitable companies. Fundamentals select research candidates; independently verified prices and trading risk checks determine an actionable state.",
  "limitations": [
    "Selection and survivorship bias: ten reviewed large issuers, concentrated in technology and AI infrastructure; many profitable growers worldwide were not screened.",
